{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed conservatory by way of its footprint, scale, mass, design and siting would have an unacceptable adverse impact on the townscape and movement of public using the area and it would be detrimental to character and appearance of the host building and the area. This would be contrary to Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policies CS8, and DM 10  of the Core Strategy (2012).",
    "The proposed conservatory by way of its footprint, scale, mass, materials, design and siting would fail to preserve the character of the Kingston Old Town Conservation Area and it would cause less than substantial harm to the Conservation Area. This would be contrary to Policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021), Policies CS8, DM 10 and DM12 of the Core Strategy (2012) and Sections 16 and 72 of The Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990 (as amended)."
  ],
